  "guide": "how-to-make-a-phone-call-you-have-been-avoiding",
  "situation": "searchedProblems[2].phrase",
  "slides": [
    {
      "kind": "cover",
      "quote": {
        "text": "I've been avoiding a phone call for weeks",
        "source": "searchedProblems[2].phrase"
      },
      "emphasis": [
        "avoiding"
      ],
      "promise": {
        "text": "How to make a phone call you keep avoiding",
        "source": "guide:how-to-make-a-phone-call-you-have-been-avoiding/title"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "answer",
      "eyebrow": {
        "text": "In short",
        "source": "micro"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "A call is several jobs at once, which is why it stalls.",
          "source": "guide:how-to-make-a-phone-call-you-have-been-avoiding/dek#0"
        },
        {
          "text": "Prepare five things on paper, write the first sentence out, and know when you can stop.",
          "source": "guide:how-to-make-a-phone-call-you-have-been-avoiding/dek#1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "eyebrow": {
        "text": "How to write each of the five",
        "source": "guide:how-to-make-a-phone-call-you-have-been-avoiding/body[3].heading"
      },
      "number": {
        "text": "1",
        "source": "micro"
      },
      "head": {
        "text": "What it's about, in one line.",
        "source": "guide:how-to-make-a-phone-call-you-have-been-avoiding/body[3].items[0]#0"
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "text": "Write it the way you'd say it to a friend: \"the double charge on my phone bill.\" If it takes two lines, it's really two calls.",
          "source": "guide:how-to-make-a-phone-call-you-have-been-avoiding/body[3].items[0]#1"
        },
        {
          "text": "Pick the one that comes first and put the other on a separate page.",
          "source": "guide:how-to-make-a-phone-call-you-have-been-avoiding/body[3].items[0]#2"
        }
      ],
      "emphasis": [
        "line"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "eyebrow": {
        "text": "How to write each of the five",
        "source": "guide:how-to-make-a-phone-call-you-have-been-avoiding/body[3].heading"
      },
      "number": {
        "text": "2",
        "source": "micro"
      },
      "head": {
        "text": "The result you want, in one line.",
        "source": "guide:how-to-make-a-phone-call-you-have-been-avoiding/body[3].items[1]#0"
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "text": "Decide it now, because it's the thing that slips away halfway through explaining how you got here.",
          "source": "guide:how-to-make-a-phone-call-you-have-been-avoiding/body[3].items[1]#1"
        },
        {
          "text": "A refund, a new date, a cancellation confirmed in writing.",
          "source": "guide:how-to-make-a-phone-call-you-have-been-avoiding/body[3].items[1]#2"
        },
        {
          "text": "If the call wanders, this line is where you come back to.",
          "source": "guide:how-to-make-a-phone-call-you-have-been-avoiding/body[3].items[1]#3"
        }
      ],
      "emphasis": [
        "result"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "eyebrow": {
        "text": "How to write each of the five",
        "source": "guide:how-to-make-a-phone-call-you-have-been-avoiding/body[3].heading"
      },
      "number": {
        "text": "3",
        "source": "micro"
      },
      "head": {
        "text": "The reference.",
        "source": "guide:how-to-make-a-phone-call-you-have-been-avoiding/body[3].items[2]#0"
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "text": "Account number, order number, booking code, or the name and address the account is under.",
          "source": "guide:how-to-make-a-phone-call-you-have-been-avoiding/body[3].items[2]#1"
        },
        {
          "text": "Put it where you can read it, not where you could find it.",
          "source": "guide:how-to-make-a-phone-call-you-have-been-avoiding/body[3].items[2]#2"
        }
      ],
      "emphasis": [
        "reference"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "eyebrow": {
        "text": "How to write each of the five",
        "source": "guide:how-to-make-a-phone-call-you-have-been-avoiding/body[3].heading"
      },
      "number": {
        "text": "4",
        "source": "micro"
      },
      "head": {
        "text": "Two facts.",
        "source": "guide:how-to-make-a-phone-call-you-have-been-avoiding/body[3].items[3]#0"
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "text": "A date and an amount, or a name and a date.",
          "source": "guide:how-to-make-a-phone-call-you-have-been-avoiding/body[3].items[3]#1"
        },
        {
          "text": "Two, not ten.",
          "source": "guide:how-to-make-a-phone-call-you-have-been-avoiding/body[3].items[3]#2"
        },
        {
          "text": "Anything more lives on the statement or email you've put next to the page.",
          "source": "guide:how-to-make-a-phone-call-you-have-been-avoiding/body[3].items[3]#3"
        }
      ],
      "emphasis": [
        "facts"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "eyebrow": {
        "text": "How to write each of the five",
        "source": "guide:how-to-make-a-phone-call-you-have-been-avoiding/body[3].heading"
      },
      "number": {
        "text": "5",
        "source": "micro"
      },
      "head": {
        "text": "The first sentence, word for word.",
        "source": "guide:how-to-make-a-phone-call-you-have-been-avoiding/body[3].items[4]#0"
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "text": "A full sentence, written out.",
          "source": "guide:how-to-make-a-phone-call-you-have-been-avoiding/body[3].items[4]#1"
        },
        {
          "text": "Leaving it as \"I'll work out how to begin\" is how the number stays in your phone another week.",
          "source": "guide:how-to-make-a-phone-call-you-have-been-avoiding/body[3].items[4]#2"
        }
      ],
      "emphasis": [
        "sentence"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "checklist",
      "eyebrow": {
        "text": "Set up the room",
        "source": "guide:how-to-make-a-phone-call-you-have-been-avoiding/body[4].heading"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The five things are on one page, in front of you.",
          "source": "guide:how-to-make-a-phone-call-you-have-been-avoiding/body[4].items[0]#0"
        },
        {
          "text": "A pen, and space on the page to write the reference they give you.",
          "source": "guide:how-to-make-a-phone-call-you-have-been-avoiding/body[4].items[1]#0"
        },
        {
          "text": "You've checked when the line is open, and picked one exact time inside those hours.",
          "source": "guide:how-to-make-a-phone-call-you-have-been-avoiding/body[4].items[2]#0"
        },
        {
          "text": "You're somewhere you can talk without being overheard, if the call is personal.",
          "source": "guide:how-to-make-a-phone-call-you-have-been-avoiding/body[4].items[3]#0"
        },
        {
          "text": "Speakerphone or earbuds are ready, if having both hands free helps you write.",
          "source": "guide:how-to-make-a-phone-call-you-have-been-avoiding/body[4].items[4]#0"
        }
      ],
      "ticks": true
    },
